Changes for Asciiquarium

asciiquarium-plus 1.3.0 2026-10-02
	- Every 4 seconds a new fish swims in named after a running
	  Claude Code session, read from ~/.claude/sessions

asciiquarium-plus 1.2.0 2026-09-29
	- Optional config file (~/.config/asciiquarium-plus/config) for the
	  default decoration and cooldown; anything invalid falls back to the
	  built-in defaults

asciiquarium-plus 1.1.0 2026-09-29
	- Each scene opens with a random event instead of always the shark

asciiquarium-plus 1.0.0 2026-09-29
	- Sunken decorations: treasure chest, skull and anchor (-d)
	- A random sunken decoration is picked for every scene by default
	- Events (shark, fish hook, ship, dolphins, big fish, ducks, sea
	  monster, swan, whale) take turns in a fixed order with a shared
	  cooldown between them (-e, default 30 seconds)
	- Tests, Perl::Critic lint and CI

Version 1.1 2013-03-09
	- Automatically redraw when the terminal size changes
	- Added fish hook, swan, ducks and dolphins
	- Updated GPL license file
	
Version 1.0 2005-09-02
	- Initial public release
